I would use the following product acceptance standards before considering the first release ready.

| Area                  | What must work correctly                                                                          |
| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Environment switching | Users can move between both environments reliably without accidental switches                     |
| Navigation            | Every main screen and control works as intended                                                   |
| Transaction creation  | Entries immediately update the correct accounts and reports                                       |
| Transaction editing   | Users can correct, split and undo financial records                                               |
| Budget calculations   | Spending, remaining amounts and rollovers are accurate                                            |
